### Refresh Token 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "RefreshToken"
}


### 청소 검사 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/check/101
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer AccessToken


